                   pair 15)\n          3  Boat or boot?   There’s water in my  boat / boot.                                      pair 16)\n          4  Woke  or walk?   I woke  / walk the dog.                                               pair 17)\n          5  Phoned  or found?   Tim  phoned  / found het.                                          pair 18)\n\n            Follow up: Record yourself saying the sentences in 16.4, choosing one\n            of the two words. Make a note of which words you say. Then listen to\n            your recording in about two weeks. Is it clear which words you said?\n\n\n                                                                                       Now  go to Unit 36\n\n\n                                                                        English Pronunciation in Use     4l", "char_count": 2744, "mean_conf": 87.46, "word_count": 343, "words": [{"text": "16.1", "x0": 40, "y0": 179, "x1": 136, "y1": 219, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "16.2", "x0": 41, "y0": 1061, "x1": 144, "y1": 1122, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "one", "x0": 89, "y0": 1115, "x1": 111, "y1": 1124, "conf": 43, "bold": false}, {"text": "‘A77)", "x0": 76, "y0": 1123, "x1": 146, "y1": 1170, "conf": 33, "bold": false}, {"text": "16.3", "x0": 43, "y0": 1491, "x1": 145, "y1": 1546, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "A78)", "x0": 78, "y0": 1547, "x1": 146, "y1": 1591, "conf": 61, "bold": false}, {"text": "16.4", "x0": 46, "y0": 2030, "x1": 149, "y1": 2085, "conf": 94, "bold": false}, {"text": "A79", "x0": 80, "y0": 2098, "x1": 135, "y1": 2136, "conf": 92, "bold": false}, {"text": "Exercises", "x0": 208, "y0": 42, "x1": 533, "y1": 107, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "Find", "x0": 202, "y0": 185, "x1": 271, "y1": 219, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "14", "x0": 292, "y0": 188, "x1": 331, "y1": 219, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "words", "x0": 345, "y0": 185, "x1": 449, "y1": 219, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "in", "x0": 4